  triage:findingId "AW-POOL-V9-FIX-7" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr closure pass on integrate/phase-aw at e8825d5cc. mailbox_reader.rs now exposes a shared pub(crate) read_lane_storage_error() helper (preserving code/message/cause), used by both mailbox_reader.rs's storage_error() and search_reader.rs's submit()/submit_tool() paths -- the prior duplicated per-file collapse-to-Unavailable logic is gone. Confirmed by direct grep of both files on the merged head." ;
